From: T110 bring-up <t110-build@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] vfs: accept O_PATH descriptors for fstat

Backport upstream 55815f70147dcfa3ead5738fd56d3574e2e3c1c2
(vfs: make O_PATH file descriptors usable for fstat()).
Android 13 bionic realpath() opens O_PATH then calls fstat(). Without
this change, SELinux restorecon aborts init with EBADF.

--- a/fs/stat.c
+++ b/fs/stat.c
@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@ EXPORT_SYMBOL(vfs_getattr);
 
 int vfs_fstat(unsigned int fd, struct kstat *stat)
 {
-	struct file *f = fget(fd);
+	struct file *f = fget_raw(fd);
 	int error = -EBADF;
 
 	if (f) {
